-- The query is killed while the worker holds its first batches (one or two of them, so only that some arrived is shown):
-- each worker that got one gets one cancel for the query and ignores every task of its batch, no task id is remembered, and
-- no task runs. initial_query_logged shows that the lookup of the tasks finds the query.
┌─batches_arrived─┬─one_cancel_per_worker─┬─all_arrived_ignored─┬─remembered─┬─initial_query_logged─┬─ran─┐
│               1 │                     1 │                   1 │          0 │                    1 │   0 │
└─────────────────┴───────────────────────┴─────────────────────┴────────────┴──────────────────────┴─────┘
